{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to DECON Protocol!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GAME DESCRIPTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into sci-fi alien worlds where you deconstruct aliens into parts to upgrade your base.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attempt to wipe out the Aliens plaguing each planet and build your base and DECON Unit to produce higher outputs, more damage, more gains, and JUST MORE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> DECON Protocol offers a challenge to see what heights you can reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778410/extras/LaserAttacking.gif?t=1749039421\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Several Overlapping Systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deconstruct aliens to gather their pieces and parts in order to upgrade a multitude of systems including: Employee Training, DECON upgrades, DECON Overclocking, Gene Splicing, Studies that grant buffs, Missions, Geode Mines, Toxic Waste trading, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778410/extras/windows.png?t=1749039421\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Most systems reset on Wormhole (Prestige), but many also have a SPECIALIZATION BAR which grants permanent upgrades for each system that carry through prestige.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778410/extras/factionBar.png?t=1749039421\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are also daily login bonuses, weekly login bonuses, extra idle gains while playing that store in a chest, and offline progression and gains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778410/extras/Screenshot_22.png?t=1749039421\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Manage your own base today and wipe out the alien scourge overwhelming the planets in your sector!</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3778410?t=1749039421","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778410/1a4850a19f2b564091abe360a12cb0f093ac7552/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749039421","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778410/d4620b0e22eecd3a23b829dc9171a470413641dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749039421","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778410/d4620b0e22eecd3a23b829dc9171a470413641dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749039421","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to DECON Protocol!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GAME DESCRIPTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into sci-fi alien worlds where you deconstruct aliens into parts to upgrade your base.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attempt to wipe out the Aliens plaguing each planet and build your base and DECON Unit to produce higher outputs, more damage, more gains, and JUST MORE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> DECON Protocol offers a challenge to see what heights you can reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778410/extras/LaserAttacking.gif?t=1749039421\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Several Overlapping Systems.</p><p class=\"bb_para